course: dictionary
lesson: 14493
title: Short forms: PC and pc
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words are shortened to a few letters, so people can write them quickly. These short forms are called abbreviations. The short form pc can stand for more than one thing, so the context tells you which meaning is right. «I type my homework on the PC in the library.» Here, PC is a computer.
explain: «PC Jones helped the lost child find her mum.» A PC is a police constable, the lowest rank of police officer. Look for clues: the name, the child, and helping are all about police work, not computers.
explain: «That joke was not very PC, so we did not tell it at school.» PC here means politically correct: language or behaviour that tries not to offend groups of people. It is sometimes said in a mocking way. Ask yourself: does this meaning fit the sentence?
fact: PC can mean personal computer, often a desktop or laptop that is not an Apple Mac.
fact: In the UK, PC is short for Police Constable, the lowest rank of police officer.
fact: PC can also mean politically correct, about language that tries not to offend groups of people.
fact: Lowercase pc can mean per cent, as in «Only 5 pc of the class forgot their books.»
fact: Lowercase pc can also mean piece in short notes, as in «Add 1 pc of cheese.»
exercise: «I type my homework on the PC in the library.» What does PC mean here? | Politically correct | Per cent | *Personal computer | Police constable
exercise: «PC Jones helped the lost child find her mum.» What does PC mean here? | Per cent | Personal computer | Piece | *Police constable
exercise: «That joke was not very PC.» What does PC suggest? | A police joke | A computer joke | *It might offend people | A piece of cake
test: «Only 5 pc of the class forgot their books.» What does pc mean? | Politically correct | *Per cent | Personal computer | Police constable
test: Which words does PC stand for in «PC Jones»? | *Police Constable | Personal Computer | Piece of Cheese | Politically Correct
exam: «Add 1 pc of cheese to the list.» What does pc mean in this short note? | Police constable | *Piece | Per cent | Personal computer
